 To send an email with the given content and recipient, you can use the `send_email` function. Here's an example of how to call this function:

```json
{
  "name": "send_email",
  "arguments": {
    "recipients": ["mark.black-2134@gmail.com"],
    "subject": "Important message!",
    "body": "Hey, how is it going?"
  }
}
```

This will send an email with the specified subject and body to the provided recipient. The function returns a dictionary containing details about the sent email.
